#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:5 e2ad181573164515a18c495cda272ad0
msgid "安装和启动"
msgstr "Installation and launch"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:7 5eb78518d637428abbb7c2c5a53ce767
msgid "`nepkit` 启动后立即报错"
msgstr "`nepkit` fails immediately after launch"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:9 29b10f6f3200432cb9653203f8858049
msgid "确认当前终端已激活安装 NepTrainKit 的环境。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the current terminal has activated the environment where "
"NepTrainKit is installed."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:10
#: 64e64016b78c4463be912338c3ec103d
msgid ""
"运行 `python -c \"import NepTrainKit; "
"print(NepTrainKit.__file__)\"`，确认导入来自预期环境。"
msgstr ""
"Run `python -c \"import NepTrainKit; print(NepTrainKit.__file__)\"` and "
"confirm that the import comes from the expected environment."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:11
#: 9bd8cfa2fdd54717a1804efce2e4079e
msgid "如果 traceback 指向某个缺失模块，重新核对安装是否完整，不要在多个环境间单独复制包文件。"
msgstr ""
"If the traceback points to a missing module, verify that the installation"
" is complete; do not copy package files between environments."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:12
#: 80a860a909ed41d79ab9bdf5e9df430c
msgid "如果是 macOS Dock 图标提示但主窗口仍能打开，应保留完整 traceback 判断是否只是图标初始化失败。"
msgstr ""
"If macOS reports a Dock-icon warning while the main window opens, keep "
"the full traceback to determine whether only icon initialization failed."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:14
#: 6b0a428e45284bd885b1d44db8bb00fc
msgid "安装和运行时检查见[快速开始](../quickstart.md)。"
msgstr "See [Quick start](../quickstart.md) for installation and runtime checks."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:16
#: f45911ab8c0d49629f274ac4d10e9390
msgid "CUDA 不可用或自动回退到 CPU"
msgstr "CUDA unavailable or automatically falling back to CPU"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:18
#: 64cd019b393c4d8296589dd78f1360bb
msgid "先运行："
msgstr "Run first:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:20
#: 59df1800b5694c4f86092240a6309687
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:24
#: 130b1b54ae33434181c842046eb63475
msgid ""
"`Auto` 会使用可用后端并说明 CUDA 不可用原因。只有必须使用 GPU 时才在设置中强制选 "
"`CUDA`；强制选择但运行时不可用会明确失败。详细入口见[设置](../module/settings.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`Auto` uses an available backend and reports why CUDA is unavailable. "
"Force `CUDA` in Settings only when GPU execution is required; an "
"unavailable forced backend fails explicitly. See "
"[Settings](../module/settings.md) for details."

