#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:41
#: 11a77534bff8483db7eb5776e2427482
msgid "LAMMPS dump 提示缺少元素映射"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:43
#: 2924256faf894d8da27a3ef5328f72f4
msgid ""
"只有数值 `type` 的 dump 不能自动知道真实元素。导入时提供完整的“类型编号 → 元素”映射， 或者在 dump 中直接写出 "
"`element` 列。坐标还必须完整使用 `xs/ys/zs`、`x/y/z` 或 `xu/yu/zu` 中的一组。"
msgstr ""
"A dump containing only numeric `type` values cannot identify the actual elements. Provide "
"a complete type-to-element mapping during import, or include an `element` column in the "
"dump. Coordinates must also use one complete set: `xs/ys/zs`, `x/y/z`, or `xu/yu/zu`."

