#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:107
#: 17d39c913c1b424389ada5610cf845ef
msgid "能量平移后找不到原始能量"
msgstr "Details for this option"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:109
#: e34c198a86c44b2c9ac57a94fae820bc
msgid ""
"第一次平移前的结构总能量写入 `energy_original`，新值写在 `energy`。导出 EXTXYZ 后检查这两个 "
"帧级字段。再次平移不会覆盖已经保存的 `energy_original`。详见 [能量基线平移](../module/nep-main-tool-"
"energy-shift.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Before the first shift, the structure's total energy is saved in `energy_original`, and the "
"shifted value is written to `energy`. After exporting EXTXYZ, check both frame fields. A later "
"shift does not overwrite the existing `energy_original`. See [Energy baseline shift](../module/"
"nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md)."

